{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-abyure",
  "id": "source-36902",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "36902001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "……刚才抱歉了，小奏。我全都想起来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "现在整理一下现状……这里已经不是原来的世界了，是吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "是的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "我们变得像是动画周边的那种塑料小人一样……除此之外，似乎没有感觉到异常呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "不过，这副身体……还需要进食吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "这段时间并没有感觉饿。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "总之，我们先离开这里，去收集更多的情报吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "那边有光线透进来，出口离我们并不远。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "好，就这样决定了！\n以这里为起点，开始新世界的探索吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "当然，是我们两个一起哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "请等一下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "我要回去拿「Angel Player」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "啊，那个东西你居然也带到这个世界了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "不知道，醒来的时候就在我身边了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "难道说，你的能力在这里也能继续使用？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "嗯。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "「防御技能·音速手刃」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "……看上去真是和记忆里一模一样呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "……不见了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "再在周围找找，可能是落在别的地方了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "不，百合，我记得很清楚。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "我就放在这个箱子边上……但现在找不到了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "奇怪，这个仓库里，应该只有我们两个人在。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "刚才……出口那似乎闪过了一个影子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "哎，虽然现在不知道这是做什么用的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "但我的预感告诉我——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36902027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "很快，M城就能有大乐子看了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
